WEBVTT

00:13:57.496 --> 00:14:00.496
I wondered if there's a there is a
parallel in chimp society there

00:14:00.496 --> 00:14:01.496
as well.

00:14:02.662 --> 00:14:08.412
I don't think so, I mean, they you know,
they don't so far as I can understand,

00:14:08.412 --> 00:14:11.162
they don't think things through like that.

00:14:11.204 --> 00:14:13.871
They just do what their nature
tells them to do.

00:14:14.537 --> 00:14:17.996
And a female behaves like
a bite, like a female.

00:14:18.204 --> 00:14:20.954
We had one female who was sterile.

00:14:20.954 --> 00:14:26.537
She never produced an infant, and she
behaved much more like a male.

00:14:26.579 --> 00:14:31.662
And yet at the same time, she had female
characteristics and she adopted